++Unused runtime-owned buffer backing now joins the existing spare cache. Foreground allocations can reuse its mapping and address buffer before another native allocation. Buffer spares retain the shared 64 MiB budget, expire after ten seconds and are released on memory pressure or allocation failure. Imported memory keeps its original owner and release ordering.
